flowchart LR
  I[GitHub Issue] --> F{Boundary / author / label?}
  F -->|No| Idle[Do not launch AI]
  F -->|Yes| C[Paseo Coordinator]
  C --> P[Plan]
  P --> B[Build]
  B --> V[Verify fixed SHA]
  V --> R[Independent review]
  R -->|Findings| B
  R -->|Accepted| D[Draft PR]
  D --> M{Explicit low-risk merge auth?}
  M -->|No / uncertain| H[Keep Draft PR]
  M -->|Yes, protections pass| Merge[Merge verified candidate]
